Dialogue: 1,0:00:00.00,0:00:30.91,Hook,,0,0,0,,CERRADO POR NUESTRA\NCULPA
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.12,0:00:02.98,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,0)}Vamos, bro, ¿dónde consigo\Ncomida?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.74,0:00:05.90,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,0)}¿No hay una tienda por\Naquí?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.10,0:00:08.14,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,0)}Mierda.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.10,0:00:11.66,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,0)}¿Hay una gasolinera cerca?\NPero...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.23,0:00:15.05,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,0)}está Hank's Waffles, vamos\Nprimero por comida.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.49,0:00:16.23,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,0)}¡Maldita sea!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.25,0:00:18.17,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,0)}Acabo de chocar el carro,\Nya está echando humo.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.17,0:00:18.75,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,0)}Dios.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.53,0:00:23.35,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,0)}Soy un idiota. Espera.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.55,0:00:25.05,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,0)}Está cerrado.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.33,0:00:26.69,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,0)}Ah...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.87,0:00:30.07,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,0)}Nosotros asaltamos este\Nlugar.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.13,0:00:30.79,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,0)}Es nuestra culpa.
